			"notes": "## 2.5.0-alpha.2\n\n### Added\n\n- **Pokémon Valuable Items**: Added 10 classic valuable items (`nugget`, `big_nugget`, `pearl`, `big_pearl`, `pearl_string`, `stardust`, `star_piece`, `comet_shard`, `rare_bone`, `balm_mushroom`) with custom 16x16 pixel-art textures, immersive lore, and creative tab integration. Suggested by Yuxo on Discord.\n- **European Spanish Localization (`es_es`)**: Added full Spanish (Spain) language support (`es_es.json`) across all mod features, items, blocks, commands, and configurations.\n- **Valuable Item Localizations**: Added names, Pokémon lore descriptions, and commercial value tooltips for all valuable items across English (`en_us`), Spanish (`es_ec`, `es_es`), and Brazilian Portuguese (`pt_br`)."
		},
